# Rendee REST API Checklist

## 1. Authentication & Common APIs
- `POST /api/v1/auth/register` - Register a new user with a specific user role (Patient, Doctor, Center, Pharmacist).
- `POST /api/v1/auth/login` - Authenticate a user and retrieve a token.
- `POST /api/v1/auth/logout` - Invalidate active session/token.
- `POST /api/v1/auth/password/reset` - Request a password reset token.
- `POST /api/v1/auth/2fa/enable` - Setup Two-Factor Authentication.
- `POST /api/v1/auth/passkeys/register` - Register WebAuthn/Passkey credential.
- `GET /api/v1/profile` - Retrieve authenticated user profile.
- `PUT /api/v1/profile` - Update profile completion info.
- `POST /api/v1/devices` - Register active device for notifications.
- `GET /api/v1/catalogs/wilayas` - List available wilayas.
- `GET /api/v1/catalogs/specialities` - List specialties.
- `GET /api/v1/catalogs/center-types` - List categories of medical centers.
- `GET /api/v1/notifications` - Retrieve past system notifications.
- `PATCH /api/v1/notifications/{id}/read` - Mark specific notification as read.

## 2. Patient API (Client Side)
- `GET /api/v1/patients/search` - Search for doctors, centers, or pharmacies by location, specialty, etc.
- `GET /api/v1/patients/doctors/{id}` - View doctor bio, schedule, and services.
- `GET /api/v1/patients/centers/{id}` - View center details, working hours, and services.
- `GET /api/v1/patients/recent-searches` - Fetch recent search tags.
- `POST /api/v1/bookings` - Submit a booking request for a doctor or center.
- `GET /api/v1/bookings` - List patient appointments.
- `GET /api/v1/bookings/{id}` - Details of a specific appointment.
- `POST /api/v1/bookings/{id}/respond-proposal` - Accept or reject reschedule proposals.
- `POST /api/v1/bookings/{id}/cancel` - Cancel a booking.
- `POST /api/v1/ratings` - Leave a star rating and review.

## 3. Doctor API (Provider Side)
- `GET /api/v1/doctor/dashboard` - Quick stats and daily booking summary.
- `GET /api/v1/doctor/bookings` - Fetch list of bookings requested with the doctor.
- `PATCH /api/v1/doctor/bookings/{id}/status` - Set booking status (e.g., accept, complete, cancel).
- `POST /api/v1/doctor/bookings/{id}/propose-reschedule` - Propose alternative date/time.
- `GET /api/v1/doctor/schedule` - Fetch doctor's weekly base schedule.
- `PUT /api/v1/doctor/schedule` - Define or adjust base weekly schedule slots.
- `GET /api/v1/doctor/services` - List services doctor offers.
- `POST /api/v1/doctor/services` - Add a new service with price & duration.
- `PUT /api/v1/doctor/services/{id}` - Update/delete an existing service.
- `PATCH /api/v1/doctor/availability` - Toggle doctor availability flag.

## 4. Center / Lab API (Provider Side)
- `GET /api/v1/center/dashboard` - Overview of bookings and active slots.
- `GET /api/v1/center/bookings` - Retrieve appointments booked with the center.
- `PATCH /api/v1/center/bookings/{id}/status` - Update status of an appointment.
- `POST /api/v1/center/bookings/{id}/propose-reschedule` - Send rescheduling options to patient.
- `GET /api/v1/center/working-hours` - Retrieve custom working hours and slots.
- `POST /api/v1/center/working-hours` - Create specific dates & times for center availability.
- `GET /api/v1/center/services` - List services provided by the center.
- `POST /api/v1/center/services` - Add new services with pricing.
- `GET /api/v1/center/contacts` - Manage social media and communication links.

## 5. Pharmacist API
- `GET /api/v1/pharmacy/profile` - View pharmacy profile details.
- `PUT /api/v1/pharmacy/profile` - Update pharmacy info (location, bio, coordinates).
- `PATCH /api/v1/pharmacy/availability` - Toggle pharmacy duty/night availability.
